WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.930
Twenty-two organizations

00:00:01.742 --> 00:00:02.437
hit in a

00:00:02.249 --> 00:00:03.911
single intrusion campaign

00:00:04.446 --> 00:00:05.578
GreyNoise tracked an

00:00:05.389 --> 00:00:06.662
intrusion campaign

00:00:06.474 --> 00:00:07.500
against Check Point

00:00:07.312 --> 00:00:08.443
security management

00:00:08.255 --> 00:00:08.903
servers

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:10.377
with confirmed attacks

00:00:10.189 --> 00:00:11.993
between October 17th

00:00:11.805 --> 00:00:13.549
and November 2nd hitting

00:00:13.361 --> 00:00:14.540
at least 22

00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:15.424
organizations

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:16.889
The actor used

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:18.399
99 IP addresses

00:00:18.423 --> 00:00:20.333
mostly disposable infrastructure

00:00:20.274 --> 00:00:21.170
for scanning

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:23.788
exploitation and post-exploitation

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:24.814
inside the victims'

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:25.403
networks

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:27.537
Victims span finance

00:00:27.538 --> 00:00:29.070
energy government and

00:00:28.917 --> 00:00:30.757
manufacturing and GreyNoise

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.735
has not attributed

00:00:31.547 --> 00:00:32.478
the activity to

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:33.233
any known threat

00:00:33.045 --> 00:00:33.575
group

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.124
Full story on

00:00:34.935 --> 00:00:35.831
the dashboard
